  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.7.0 expands qBittorrent Web API coverage through v2.16.2 and adds qBittorrent 5.3.0 compatibility.\n\n\t\t\t- Adds API-key management, client-data storage, torrent metadata, SSL, piece-availability, and tracker reannounce support.\n\t\t\t- Adds combined speed limits, session pause/resume, free-space queries, RSS rule cloning, server-side file-path lookup, share-limits mode, and dotfile control.\n\t\t\t- Adds compatibility for qBittorrent 5.3.0 parameter changes and expands upstream parity tests.\n\t\t\t- Existing source calls generally remain compatible, but affected overloads with new optional parameters require recompilation of precompiled consumers.",
